                  "name": "value",
                  "value": "CA2 | ESCALATE_HUMAN | flatline is not currently confirmed or metric value is unavailable | check the monitor group, source freshness, app action ledger and virtual PLC ACK | no HOLD/CLEAR from Datadog | DECISION=UNKNOWN_OR_NO_TRIGGER | ACTION=NONE | NEXT=operator review; retain uncertainty"
                }
              ]
            },
